From: LibreELEC DV hardware port
Subject: [PATCH] nvidia R580: add kernel-private HDMI VSIF modesetting

Base: NVIDIA 580.178.04, c8e699821c23e4335bf23330a54a23d15cfb95e9.
Reuse the native Pascal HDMI packer and the DRM property contract used by Beta5.
Rebuild only the MIT modeset core; keep proprietary RM and userspace at R580.
Do not extend R580 userspace ioctl layouts. The extra modeset envelope is
accepted only from the native in-kernel KAPI client under its existing lock.

Software qualification only. Physical Pascal HDMI output remains unverified.
NVIDIA source and copyright notices are retained. VSIF construction is adapted
from NVIDIA 615; the existing Beta5/Hades max-bpc contract is reused.

